GreenFrame works with SmoovPlay (https://github.com/smoovplay/smoovplay, MIT License), which must be installed
separately. GreenFrame includes no SmoovPlay code. The bridge imports SmoovPlay's frame-tap writer
(framegen.chiaki_tap.FrameTap) from the user's own SmoovPlay installation at run time, and writes the frame-tap
layout SmoovPlay documents.

Release builds bundle Electron (https://www.electronjs.org/, MIT License) and Chromium; their licenses ship in
the release folder (LICENSE, LICENSES.chromium.html).

